<title>USA: Marciano raises stake slightly in Farah.</title>
<headline>Marciano raises stake slightly in Farah.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georges Marciano, former chairman of Yes Clothing Co, said Monday he raised his stake slightly in Farah Inc to 385,900 common shares or 7.7 percent of outstanding shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with Securities and Exchange Commission, Marciano said he bought 20,000 common shares from Sept 24 to 30 at $7.125 to $7.50 per share.</p>
<p>Marciano held 765,900 common shares or 7.5 percent of the outstanding in Farah on July 5.</p>
</text>
